  m_text: 'On an airplane, the rudder is used for making minor adjustments and corrections.
    On helicopters they do the same, but also allow it to change heading quickly
    as well as spin! These controls rotate the helicopter horizontally.


    Rudder
    (yawing) left turns left. Rudder (yawing) right turns right.


    You can yaw
    by pressing the left and right triggers respectively.


    Give it a whirl!'
